  "question_stem": "The equation is\n$$\\sqrt{x} = \\mathrm{e}^x - 3.$$",
  "context_texts": [
    "The graphs $y = \\mathrm{e}^x - 3$ and $y = \\sqrt{x}$ intersect exactly once.",
    "At convergence, $x = \\ln(3 + \\sqrt{x})$, equivalently $\\sqrt{x} = \\mathrm{e}^x - 3$."
  ],
